// Conformance fixture for MMA/func.py (DEFCALL/CALL).
// Based on egs/subroutines/subs.mma (which has no musical data, so the
// Python CLI cannot produce an oracle for it) plus a few bars, and with
// extra DefCall cases: positional, named and DEFAULT parameters, a
// parameter used as a whole chord line, and a nested call.
Time 4
TimeSig 4 4
Tempo 100
KeySig C
RndSeed 1
Groove SWING

// sets a copyright message; Name uses the default from the param list
Defcall Copyright Date, Name=Bob van der Poel
  print Adding copyright to song: $Name
  MidiCopyright $Name
  Print $Date
EndDefCall

Call Copyright Nov 2015

// Same, but use the DEFAULT keyword
Defcall Copyright Date, Name
  Default Name Bob van der Poel
  Default Date June 22, 1999
  print Adding copyright to song: $Name
  MidiCopyright $Name
  Print $Date
EndDefCall

Call Copyright Today

// Named parameters, skippable trailing params and a chord line parameter
Defcall Play chord, count=1
  $Chord
  print played $Count
EndDefCall

Call Play C
Call Play G, 2

// A nested call: the body invokes another function.
Defcall Twice name
  Call Play $Name
EndDefCall

Call Twice Dm

1 C
2 G
3 Dm
